AB  - To improve the disorder, sophistication, and lack of unified management of existing library resources, this paper proposes an information resource integration model based on linked data. We introduce the concept of relational data and its implementation conditions in the resource integration of digital library, by applying distributed comprehensive recommendation model and web mining model based on Agent technology to book information service system. Then, integrated with ontology and linked data technology, the library digital resources are organized hierarchically. In this method, the functions of user oriented information resource integration, query and recommendation are realized through RDF integration. The system test results show that the resource integration framework proposed by us can realize the full sharing of network resources by linked data technology, which effectively improves the quality of information service, and also realizes distributed intelligent search and personalized recommendation of book information resources. © 2024 The Authors.
